    "long_instructions": "## Map Your App Logic\r\n\r\nCreate a flowchart to plan how your app works.\r\n\r\n1. Use the workspace to map how user inputs lead to outcomes.\r\n\r\n2. Add conditions to show how your app makes decisions.\r\n\r\n3. Include at least one combined condition (two inputs affecting one result).\r\n\r\n4. Identify any key values your app needs to track (such as selections or scores).\r\n",
